   Yang Guo               : DLPNO-NEVPT2, F12-NEVPT2, CIM, IAO-localization
   Andreas Hansen         : Spin unrestricted coupled pair/coupled cluster methods
   Benjamin Helmich-Paris : MC-RPA, TRAH-SCF, COSX integrals
